  "releaseNotes": "Fix for 5.72.0: RevenueCat Test Store API keys (test_…) no longer force-close consumer apps in Release builds (issue #116). The xcframework is now built from source via .github/workflows/generate-ios-bindings.yml with the BYPASS_SIMULATED_STORE_RELEASE_CHECK Swift compilation flag, mirroring RevenueCat/purchases-kmp. Previous fix (5.72.0.1) covered link-time crash from unexported native classes (StoreKit2PromotionalOfferPurchaseOptions, RedirectLoggerSessionDelegate) and bgen failure from combined platform-availability attributes ([Watch, TV, Mac, iOS]).",
